{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"一种很郑重、很清醒的被触动感，同时又带着悬而未定的迟疑：这件事已经有了不能轻轻带过的分量，却还没有变成一个能够明确说出的要求。\",\"thread\":\"当一件事的重要性已经真实地压到心里，而人还不知道它究竟要求自己怎样回应时，最先出现的往往不是答案，而是认真和迟疑同时存在：不能把它放下，也还不能贸然把它说定。\",\"used\":\"无\",\"new\":[\"已经成立的是：有某种东西对人具有真实的分量，不能被随便略过。\",\"承认它的重要，并没有立刻带来明确的所求或可以安顿它的办法。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4e4fbc74-af62-41c7-929d-7da12009679e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T223859627418Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.078, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:39:20.707620+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8c5d3f2e8adde7ccfc9b5bf4e3d637a69fba5410a83f436df68e54cb9e590724", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "